//
// The brief's five (docs/product-brief.md §5):
//
// 1. ONE QUESTION: "Which solicitations can a new project be submitted under right now?"
// 2. READERS: the administrator. Hardest: one closing a solicitation while another stays open — each row's own switch answers it without touching the rest.
// 3. SERIES/SCALAR: a short list; each row a name, its project count, and one switch.
// 4. IRREVERSIBLE: nothing. Turning one off keeps its projects; only a solicitation with no projects can be deleted.
// 5. CUT: amounts, requested / secured funding, opening and closing dates, scoring and the review committee's selection, renaming.
import AppLayout from '../../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
